o not need ID for every person who will be using a scooter, just for the person whose name is on the reservation. \n\nWAIVER: Everyone riding a scooter will need to sign an individual waiver. To save time at pick-up, please have everyone in your group sign the waiver in the purple section above. \n\nRESCHEDULE: If at anytime you need to modify your reservation pick-up or drop-off time, please reply to this email or give us a call at 617-855-6006. \n\nWe sincerely appreciate you for choosing Central Scoot. Thank you so much and have a great day!\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/TUzJXQPSbCVwpBxp2JSJ)", "cancellation_notes": "🚀 Flexible Cancellation Policy – Book with Confidence!\n\nWe understand plans change! That’s why we offer easy cancellations and rescheduling options:\n\n✅ Cancel up to 48 hours before your tour for a FULL refund or 100% store credit (valid for 12 months).\n ✅ Last-minute cancellations (within 48 hours) are non-refundable, but we can reschedule you subject to availability or issue a gift certificate that will never expire. No-call no-shows forfeit their entire purchase. If you think you might not be able to make your event, please email us at support@centralscoot.com or call us as soon as possible at 617-855-6006. \n\n🔹 Weather Policy - We Ride Rain or Shine!\n\n🌦️ We ride in all weather conditions, rain or shine! Light rain? No problem! We provide rain ponchos so you can still enjoy the adventure. In the rare case of severe weather conditions (such as lightning, heavy storms, or unsafe road conditions), we will offer rescheduling at no extra charge or store credit for a future tour.\n\n💡 Summary:\n\nWe’re here to make your experience stress-free and help you book with confidence! If you have any questions or need to make changes to your booking, just reach out—we’re happy to help! 😊\n\n📞 Phone: 617-855-6006 \n📧 Email: Support@centralscoot.com\n🏠 Central Scoot - Boston Location: 199 State Street, Boston MA 02109", "no_tran